WEBVTT

00:12:28.873 --> 00:12:30.617
you can keep my kids all night!

00:12:30.641 --> 00:12:33.189
(Laughter)

00:12:33.213 --> 00:12:37.190
They took a perfectly strong
intrinsic motivation not to be late,

00:12:37.214 --> 00:12:38.523
and they cheapened it.

00:12:38.999 --> 00:12:41.771
What's worse, when they
realized their mistake

00:12:41.795 --> 00:12:44.351
and they took away
the financial incentive,

00:12:44.375 --> 00:12:46.972
the late pickups still stayed
at the high level.

00:12:46.996 --> 00:12:50.109
They had already poisoned
the social contract.

00:12:50.133 --> 00:12:53.876
Health care is full
of strong intrinsic motivations.

00:12:53.900 --> 00:12:57.911
We have doctors and patients
who already want to do the right thing.

00:12:57.935 --> 00:13:00.864
Financial incentives can help,